  Dear Raph and creative coding community,

	reimplemented the sketch from a still picture and sadly forgot the source.
	If anyone know, please leave a comment - thx! :-)

	For the challenge altered an animation which draws from the end to the start 
	to enable proper overlapping do draw it downward.
	Fading from fill color, stroke color and weight increases the perspective.

	Join the Birb's Nest Discord for friendly creative coding community
	and future challenges and contributions: https://discord.gg/S8c7qcjw2b
